Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py:1-21, 61-65, 84-89` — Preserve observation below `RunnerAgentStep`, distinct sentinel models, and ambient-override isolation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py:1-24, 74-78, 92-98, 198-205, 222-229` — Preserve per-step log attribution, declared model class, and observation at `_pai_model`. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py:1-21, 90-96, 118-124, 156-162, 189-194, 241-246` — Preserve producer-to-sidecar provenance, absence on outage, and recorder recovery. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py:1-11, 82-84` — Preserve caller-supplied graph scope and upstream default resolution. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py:1-13, 105-108` — Preserve failing-run consumption metrics, allowlist behavior, and redaction. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py:1-15, 125-128` — Preserve actionable-bank fallback and re-raise cases. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py:1-16, 147-152` — Preserve retryable disposition forwarding and botocore classification. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py:1-14, 46-49` — Preserve all prefetch reads and glob discovery against the pinned root. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py:1-24, 57-63, 73-78` — Preserve physical own-window and economic product ceilings. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py:1-31, 49-57, 125-130, 165-170, 208-213` — Preserve no-elision, model-window bound, realistic fixture shape, and pre-call refusal. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_prelude_215f.py:1-10` — Preserve diagnostic retention when prelude reads fail. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py:371-378, 666-670` — Preserve typed budget-exhaustion routing and short-run repetition rendering. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py:1-17, 493-501` — Preserve PASS-only cache scope, fingerprint rules, and concurrent last-write-wins behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py:1-15, 107-111, 118-121, 210-214, 230-236, 248-250, 255-257` — Preserve child short-circuit, certification withholding, parity pipeline, and fake signature shape. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_det_short_circuit.py:1-16` — Preserve zero-LLM short-circuit, complete DET findings, and normal passing path. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_batch.py:127-136` — Preserve required repository-relative globs and negative controls. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py:1-17, 132-134, 163-165` — Preserve narrow provenance-only projection and unavailable behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py:115-120, 401-404, 421-423, 461-463, 488-490` — Preserve structured-only editing, criterion routing, validation-before-write, and correct gate placement. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_consumption_sidecar_df94.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_degrade_b39a.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_outage_disposition_8c8a.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_prefetch_pinned_root_831f.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_context_product_bound.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_oversized_d59e.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_recovery_prelude_215f.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_token_recovery.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verdict_cache.py tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_verification_workflow.py tests/unit/workflow/test_det_short_circuit.py tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_batch.py tests/unit/workflow/test_editor_effective_policy.py tests/unit/workflow/test_editor.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_step_model_attribution.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_usage_attribution.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/workflow/test_code_review_verdict_provenance.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_child_scope.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while pres